{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"yaoci-e-o050","title":"慈严行蓐食，须明带鞬摄弓上马，将两骑自随，各作一的持之，开门直出","accounts":[{"id":"yaoci-a-f064cd3b59a7233b4434","label":"正文","text":"慈严行蓐食，须明带鞬摄弓上马，将两骑自随，各作一的持之，开门直出","evidence":["yaoci-q-c30d2648d50c1c84d67e"]},{"id":"yaoci-a-23904796549d74819d5c","label":"正文","text":"慈引马至城下堑内植的自射，明晨复如此，围下人无复起者","evidence":["yaoci-q-913f415d30727f3570ce"]},{"id":"yaoci-a-458d2d6ea0bc2f7faba1","label":"正文","text":"慈鞭马直突围中驰去，比贼觉知慈行已过，又射杀数人皆应弦而倒，故无敢追者","evidence":["yaoci-q-2ff084a3756ff18b7da3"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0003","role":"突围预备出行者；植的惑敌者；突围驰去射杀追者","evidence":["yaoci-q-c30d2648d50c1c84d67e","yaoci-q-913f415d30727f3570ce","yaoci-q-2ff084a3756ff18b7da3"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原文时间表达；各账户以所引文献为准。","evidence":["yaoci-q-c30d2648d50c1c84d67e","yaoci-q-913f415d30727f3570ce","yaoci-q-2ff084a3756ff18b7da3"]},"ordering_evidence":"yaoci-q-c30d2648d50c1c84d67e","source_order":[49,111,0],"order":8966}],"persons":[{"id":"wuzhu-p0003","name":"太史慈","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"yaoci-q-2ff084a3756ff18b7da3","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-b3577911b2375a3c7437","layer":"original","quote":"鞭马，直突围中驰去。比贼觉知〖12〗，慈行已过；又射杀数人，皆应弦而倒，故无敢追者","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":110,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":142,"end":183,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-913f415d30727f3570ce","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-b3577911b2375a3c7437","layer":"original","quote":"慈引马至城下堑内，植所持的各一〖11〗，出射之；射之毕，径入门。明晨，复如此，围下人或起或卧；慈复植的，射之毕，复入门。明晨，复出如此，无复起者","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":110,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":64,"end":136,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-c30d2648d50c1c84d67e","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-b3577911b2375a3c7437","layer":"original","quote":"于是严行蓐食〖7〗，须明〖8〗，便带鞬摄弓上马〖9〗；将两骑自随，各作一的持之〖10〗，开门直出","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":110,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":48,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
